// Compensated BFP16EBS8 dense products with F32 accumulators.
// Each packed weight record is reused across sixteen rows and sixteen output
// columns while traversing K in 128-element chunks. Explicit FIFO state keeps
// independent accumulators and load overlap visible to the AIE2P scheduler.
// The two result placements are the query and probability/value bank layouts.
target.decl @qwen3_embedding.panels.core

